@host = http://localhost:8080

### Turn 1 (blocking)
POST {{host}}/chat/42
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Hi, my name is Nazar and I live in Lviv."
}

### Turn 2 (streaming, SSE): answered from turn 1's memory
POST {{host}}/chat/42/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "question": "What is my name, and what is a good place to visit in my city?"
}

### Stored window for the conversation (what the model sees next turn)
GET {{host}}/chat/42

### Another conversation knows nothing about 42
POST {{host}}/chat/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is my name?"
}

### Long streamed answer: cancel it midway; the server keeps receiving it from Anthropic and stores the full reply
POST {{host}}/chat/99/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "question": "Write a detailed 1500-word history of Lviv."
}

### Stored window for conversation 99
GET {{host}}/chat/99

### Clear conversation 42
DELETE {{host}}/chat/42
